WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.000
This is a synthetic test pattern.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.000
Captions are parsed from WebVTT
and drawn by the player itself.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Chapter two: color bars.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Open the settings menu to lock a quality,
or right-click for stats.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Halfway there.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Try ?bw=300 in the URL to watch the
bitrate controller step down.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Outro.
